<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"410\">Uncharted: The Nathan Drake Collection is een actie-avonturengame voor de PlayStation 4 waarin je de eerste drie avonturen van schatzoeker Nathan Drake opnieuw beleeft. De collectie bevat geremasterde versies van <em data-start=\"278\" data-end=\"306\">Uncharted: Drake’s Fortune</em>, <em data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"336\">Uncharted 2: Among Thieves</em> en <em data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"372\">Uncharted 3: Drake’s Deception</em>, met verbeterde graphics en gameplay.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"438\"><strong data-start=\"412\" data-end=\"421\">Staat</strong><br data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"424\">In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"440\" data-end=\"685\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"455\">Voordelen</strong><br data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"458\">⭐ Bevat drie complete Uncharted games<br data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"498\">⭐ Geremasterde versies met verbeterde graphics<br data-start=\"544\" data-end=\"547\">⭐ Avontuurlijke verhaallijn met Nathan Drake<br data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"594\">⭐ Mix van actie, puzzels en ontdekking<br data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"635\">⭐ Geschikt voor fans van avontuur- en actiegames</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"687\" data-end=\"947\">📋 <strong data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"707\">Specificaties</strong><br data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"710\"><strong data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"723\">Platform:</strong> PlayStation 4<br data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"740\"><strong data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"750\">Titel:</strong> Uncharted: The Nathan Drake Collection<br data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"792\"><strong data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"802\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Genre:</strong> Actie / avontuur<br data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"822\"><strong data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"837\">Speelmodus:</strong> Singleplayer<br data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"853\"><strong data-start=\"853\" data-end=\"866\">Uitgever:</strong> Sony Interactive Entertainment<br data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"900\"><strong data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"913\">Leeftijd:</strong> 16+<br data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"920\"><strong data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"930\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"1044\">📦 <strong data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"967\">Meegeleverd</strong><br data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"970\">PlayStation 4 Game – Uncharted: The Nathan Drake Collection (met doosje)</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1103\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1068\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1071\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>",
